Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: openssh-client
Description: Local, zero-cloud SSH and SFTP Manager TUI
 ez-ssh is a fast, local-first SSH and SFTP Terminal User Interface (TUI)
 written in Go with Bubble Tea, Lip Gloss, and pure-Go SQLite.
 .
 It provides a hosts grid with ~/.ssh/config import, AES-256-GCM encrypted
 keychain credentials, Ed25519/RSA-4096 SSH key generation, local/remote/SOCKS5
 port forwarding tunnels, multi-line command snippets, known_hosts management,
 connection audit logs, dual-pane SFTP transfers, and embedded SSH tabs.
